{
  "title": "Duas after every obligatory Prayers",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "(1) اَللّٰهُمَّ ارْزُقْنيْ حَجَّ بَيْتِكَ الْحَرَامِ\nSayyid Ibn Tawus has narrated that Imam al-Sadiq and Imam al-Kazim (a.s.) instructed to say the following supplicatory prayer after each and every obligatory prayer all over the month of Ramazan:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ ارْزُقْنيْ حَجَّ بَيْتِكَ الْحَرَامِ\nALLAAHUMMAR ZUQNEE HAJJA BAYTEKAL HARAAME\nO Allah, (please) confer upon me with the grace of pilgrimage to Your Holy House \nفِي عَامِیْ هٰذَا وَفِیْ كُلِّ عَامٍ\nFEE A’AMEE HAAZAA WA FEE KULLE A’AAMIN\nin this year and every year \nمَا اَبْقَيْتَنِیْ فِیْ يُسْرٍ مِنْكَ وَعَافِيَةٍ،\nMAA ABQAYTANEE FEE YUSRIN MINKA WA A’AFEYATIN\nas long as You keep me alive, with easiness, good health, \nوَ سَعَةِ رِزْقٍ،\nWA SA-A’TE RIZQIN\nand expansive sustenance from You. \nوَ لَا تُخْلِنِيْ مِنْ تِلْكَ الْمَوَاقِفِ الْكَرِيْمَةِ،\nWA LAA TUKHLENEE MIN TILKAL MAWAAQEFIL KAREEMATE\nDo not deprive me of these noble situations, \nوَ الْمَشَاهِدِ الشَّرِيْفَةِ،\nWAL MASHAA-HEDISH SHAREEFATE\nholy places, \nوَ زِيَارَةِ قَبْرِ نَبِيِّكَ صَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَ اٰلِهٖ،\nWA ZEYAARATE QABRE NABIYYEKA SALAWAATOKA A’LAYHE WA AALEHI\nand visiting the tomb of Your Prophet may Your blessings be upon him and his Household. \nوَ فِيْ جَمِيْعِ حَوَاۤئِجِ الدُّنْيَا وَ الْاٰخِرَةِ\nWA FEE JAMEE-E’ HAWAA-EJID DUNYAA WAL AAKHERATE\n (Please) stand for me in all of my needs for this worldly life and the Next World. \nفَكُنْ لِيْ اَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّي اَسْاَلُكَ\nFAKUN LEE ALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALOKA\nO Allah, I beseech You regarding that \nفِيْمَا تَقْضِيْ وَ تُقَدِّرُ\nFEEMAA TAQZEE WA TOQADDERO\nwhich You decide and determine \nمِنَ الْاَمْرِ الْمَحْتُوْمِ فِيْ لَيْلَةِ الْقَدْرِ،\nMENAL AMRIL MAHTOOME FEE LAYLATIL QADRE\nfrom the inevitable decisions that You make on the Grand Night decisions \nمِنَ الْقَضَاۤءِ الَّذِيْ لَا يُرَدُّ\nMENAL QAZAAA-IL LAZEE LAA YORADDO\nthat are neither retreated \nوَلَا يُبَدَّلُ اَنْ تَكْتُبَنِيْ\nWA LAA YOBADDALO AN TAKTOBANEE\nnor altered to include me with \nمِنْ حُجَّاجِ بَيْتِكَ الْحَرَامِ\nMIN HUJJAAJE BAYTEKAL HARAAMIL\nthe pilgrims to Your Holy House \nالْمَبْرُوْرِ حَجُّهُمُ\nMABROORE HAJJOHOMUL\nwhose pilgrimage is admitted by You, \nالْمَشْكُوْرِ سَعْيُهُمْ\nMASHKOORE SA’YOHOMUL\nwhose efforts are thankfully accepted by You, \nالْمَغْفُوْرِ ذُنُوْبُهُمُ\nMAGHFOORE ZONOOBOHOMUL\nwhose sins are forgiven by You, \nالْمُكَفَّرِ عَنْهُمْ سَيِّئَاتُهُمْ\nMOKAFFARE A’NHUM SAYYE-AATOHUM\nand whose offenses are pardoned by You. \nوَ اجْعَلْ فِيْمَا تَقْضِيْ وَ تُقَدِّرُ\nWAJ A’L FEEMAA TAQZEE WA TOQADDERO\nWithin Your determined decisions, \nاَنْ تُطِيْلَ عُمْرِیْ،\nAN TOTEELA U’MREE\nplease decide for me a long life, \nوَ تُوَسِّعَ عَلَیَّ رِزْقِیْ\nWA TOWASSE-A’ A’LAYYA AMAANATEE WA DAYNEE\nexpansive sustenance, \nوَ تُؤَدِّىَ عَنِّیْ اَمَانَتِیْ وَ دَيْنِيْ\nWA TOADDEYA A’NNEE AMAANATEE WA DAYNEE\nand help to fulfill my trusts and settle my debts. \nاٰمِيْنَ رَبَّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ.\nAAMEENA RABBAL A’ALAMEENA.\nRespond to me, O Lord of the worlds!",
  "tabs": [
    "(2) يَا عَلِيُّ يَا عَظِيْمُ\nYou may also say the following supplicatory prayer after all obligatory prayers in Ramazan:\nيَا عَلِيُّ يَا عَظِيْمُ، \nYAA A’LIYYO YAA A’ZEEM\nO Most High! O All Great! \nيَا غَفُوْرُ يَا رَحِيْمُ،\nYAA GHAFOORO YAA RAHEEM\nO All-forgiving! O All-merciful!\nاَنْتَ الرَّبُّ الْعَظِيْمُ الَّذِيْ\nANTAR RABBUL A’ZEEMUL LAZEE\nYou are the All-great Lord \nلَيْسَ كَمِثْلِهٖ شَيْءٌ\nLAYSA KAMISLEHI SHAY-UN\nlike Whom there is nothing, \nوَ هُوَ السَّمِيْعُ الْبَصِيْرُ،\nWA HOWAS SAMEEU’L BASEERO\nand He is the All Hearing, the All-aware. \nوَ هٰذَا شَهْرٌ عَظَّمْتَهٗ وَ كَرَّمْتَهٗ،\nWA HAAZAA SHAHRUN A’ZZAMTAHU WA KARRAMTAHU\nThis is a month that You have glorified, ennobled, \nوَ شَرَّفْتَهٗ وَ فَضَّلْتَهٗ عَلَى الشُّهُوْرِ،\nWA SHARRAFTAHU WA FAZZALTAHU A’LASH SHOHOORE\nhonored, and preferred to the other months. \nوَ هُوَ الشَّهْرُ الَّذِيْ فَرَضْتَ صِيَامَهٗ عَلَيَّ،\nWA HOWASH SHAHRUL LAZEE FARAZTA SEYAAMAHU A’LAYYA\nIt is the month that You imposed upon me to observe fasting in it. \nوَ هُوَ شَهْرُ رَمَضَانَ،\nWA HOWA SHAHRO RAMAZAANAL\nIt is the month of Ramazan \nالَّذِيْ اَنْزَلْتَ فِيْهِ الْقُرْاٰنَ،\nLAZEE ANZALTA FEEHIL QUR-AANA\nduring which You revealed the Qur'an \nهُدًى لِّلنَّاسِ وَبَيِّنَاتٍ مِّنَ الْهُدىٰ وَالْفُرْقَانِ،\nHODAL LIN-NAASE WA BAYYENAATIM MENAL HODAA WAL FURQAAN\nas guidance for people, clear proofs on true guidance, and distinction (between the right and the wrong). \nوَ جَعَلْتَ فِيْهِ لَيْلَةَ الْقَدْرِ،\nWA JA-A’LTA FEEHI LAYLATAL QADRE\nYou decided the Grand Night to be in it \nوَ جَعَلْتَهَا خَيْرًا مِّنْ اَلْفِ شَهْرٍ،\nWA JA-A’LTAHAA KHAYRAM MIN ALFE SHAHRIN\nand You have decided it to be more favorable that one thousand months. \nفَيَا ذَا الْمَنِّ وَ لَا يُمَنُّ عَلَيْكَ،\nFAYAA ZAL MANNE WA LAA YOMANNO A’LAYKA\nSo, O Lord of graces! None can ever do favor to You!\nمُنَّ عَلَيَّ بِفَكَاكَ رَقَبَتِيْ مِنَ النَّارِ\nMUNNA A’LAYYA BE-FAKAAKE RAQABATEE MENAN NAARE\nPlease, do me a favor by releasing me from the Fire \nفِيْمَنْ تَمُنُّ عَلَيْهِ،\nFEEMAN TAMUNNO A’LAYHE\nand by including me with those to whom You do this favor, \nوَاَدْخِلْنِى الْجَنَّةَ\nWA ADKHILNIL JANNATA\nand allow me to enter Paradise, \nبِرَحْمَتِكَ يَا اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ.\nBERAHMATEKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHEMEEN.\non account of Your mercy. O most Merciful of all those who show mercy!",
    "(3) اَللّٰهُمَّ اَدْخِلْ\nIn al-Misbah and in al-Balad al-Amin, Shaykh al-Kaf’ami, as well as Shaykh al-Shahid in al-Majmu’ah, have narrated that the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) said that one who says the following supplicatory prayer after each obligatory prayer in Ramadan will have all his sins forgiven up to the Resurrection Day:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَدْخِلْ عَلٰی اَهْلِ الْقُبُوْرِ السُّرُوْرِ \nALLAAHUMMA ADKHIL A’LAA AHLIL QOBOORIS SOROORE\nO Allah, instill happiness in the spirits of the inhabitants of the grave. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَغْنِ كُلَّ فَقِیْرٍ \nALLAAHUMMA AGHNE KULLA FAQEERIN \nO Allah, enrich every indigent. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَشْبِعْ كُلَّ جَائِعٍ \nALLAAHUMMA ASH-BE’ KULLA JAA-E-I’N \nO Allah, satisfy every hungry person. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اكْسُ كُلَّ عُرْیَانٍ \nALLAAHUMMAK SO KULLA U’RYAANIN \nO Allah, clothe every unclothed one. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اقْضِ دَیْنَ كُلِّ مَدِیْنٍ \nALLAAHUMMAQ ZE DAYNA KULLE MADEENIN \nO Allah, facilitate the payment of every indebted one. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَرِّجْ عَنْ كُلِّ مَكْرُوْبٍ \nALLAAHUMMA FARRIJ A’N KULLE MAKROOBIN \nO Allah, relieve every deeply anguished one. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ رُدَّ كُلَّ غَرِیْبٍ \nALLAAHUMMA RUDDA KULLA GHAREEBIN \nO Allah, return every stranger. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ فُكَّ كُلَّ اَسِیْرٍ \nALLAAHUMMA FUKKA KULLA ASEERIN \nO Allah, free every captive. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَصْلِحْ كُلَّ فَاسِدٍ \nALLAAHUMMA ASLEH KULLA FAASEDIN \nO Allah, reform every uneven \nمِنْ اُمُوْرِ الْمُسْلِمِیْنَ \nMIN OMOORIL MUSLEMEENA \naffair of the Muslims. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اشْفِ كُلَّ مَرِیْضٍ \nALLAAHUMMASH FE KULLA MAREEZIN \nO Allah, cure every sick person. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ سُدَّ فَقْرَنَا بِغِنَاكَ \nALLAAHUMMA SUDDA FAQRANAA BE-GHENAAKA \nO Allah, fill our poverty with your needlessness. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ غَیِّرْ سُوْءَ حَالِنَا بِحُسْنِ حَالِكَ \nALLAAHUMMA GHAYYIR SOO-A HAALANAA BE-HUSNE HAALEKA\nO Allah, change our unpleasant state into Your beautiful state. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اقْضِ عَنَّا الدَّیْنَ وَ اَغْنِنَا مِنَ الْفَقْرِ \nALLAAHUMMAQ ZE A’NNAD DAYNA WA AGHNENAA MENAL FAQRE \nO Allah, facilitate the payment of our debt and make us needless. \nاِنَّكَ عَلٰی كُلِّ شَیْءٍ قَدِیْرٌ.\nINNAKA A’LAA KULLE SHAY-IN QADEERUN.\nSurely You are All-Powerful over everything."
